      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Mara Voss:</b> The legacy operations relay wrapped an RCE response order in reversible encodings. Recover the exact instruction before the response team acts on it.",
      "taskInstructions": "Peel one encoding at a time, always the outermost layer first; the analysis readout names the signature of the current text for free. Three wrong decodes lock the intercept.",
      "taskQuestion": "Decode the RCE response instruction.",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Mara Voss:</b> You recovered the exact instruction: preserve logs and capture memory. Both actions protect volatile incident evidence."
